Epoka, the Corporate, HR and BtoB communications agency. 
The world has become intricate, companies are constantly evolving, and time compresses everything. To deal with this age of excitement, we help companies to resume control of the time in order to be a great partner with the right speech for each audience, at every moment, in every media. We develop brands and strategies around corporate, HR, and BtoB problematics. Our clients are companies (from small to very big ones), institutions, schools and startups and we stand by their side to handle their challenges about information, accession, recruitment, acquisition, engagement&hellip; 
In 2020, Epoka went along more than 300 clients with our 200 collaborators and managed to make a turnover up 40 million euros. The agency is headed by Mathieu Gabai and Manuel Lagny. Epoka is present in more than 40 countries through its various international networks of committed, agile and independent agencies.

GP is an "innovative start-up" born recently in L'Aquila, officially recognized as an "academic spin-off" of the University of L'Aquila - Department of Engineering and Information Sciences and Mathematics (DISIM), and currently undergoing formal qualification as a "Global Service Alliance Partner" by SALESFORCE itself.
GP is mainly focused on the following technological areas:
· Services delivered in Cloud (Salesforce, Microsoft Azure);
· Customer (or «Citizen») Relationship Management (CRM);
· IoT (Internet of Things);
· Big Data and Data Analisys;
· Artificial Intelligence (Machine / Deep Learning, algorithms).
